{"id":"7ee1f80d5a223006","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-degree-cofinality.md","title":"Cofinality and Sufficiently Large Degrees","display":"df-degree-cofinality — Cofinality and Sufficiently Large Degrees","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-degree-cofinality","aliases":["67-df-degree-cofinality"],"display":"df-degree-cofinality — Cofinality and Sufficiently Large Degrees","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"7","source_label":"cofinal before Lemma 7.9; sufficiently large after Lemma 7.9","source_printed_pages":[98,99],"source_pdf_pages":[109,110],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"definition-and-signature-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-degree-cofinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-degree-cofinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-cofinality — Cofinality and Sufficiently Large Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"cofinal before Lemma 7.9; sufficiently large after Lemma 7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>98</span><span>99</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>109</span><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-and-signature-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf1_T\">\\(D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf1_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq D_T\">\\(G\\subseteq D_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq D_T\">\\(P\\subseteq D_T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Eventually}_T\\)</span> 是下式定义的一元集合谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists b\\in G\\;(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists b\\in G\\;(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists b\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\forall c\\in D_T\\;(b\\leq_Tc&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to c\\in P))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists b\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\forall c\\in D_T\\;(b\\leq_Tc&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to c\\in P))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的 cofinal 针对去掉顶元后的严格共尾性：要求高于每个非顶度，并且新度仍非顶。不能用包含顶元的集合平凡满足。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(P)\\)</span> 精确翻译“every sufficiently large degree has property <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>”，其尾段包含起点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>。这些只是集合谓词；没有引入未定义的“足够大”原语。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$G\\subseteq D_T$，$P\\subseteq D_T$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq D_T","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a<_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists b\\in G\\;(a<_Tb<_T\\mathbf1_T)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a<_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\exists b\\in D_T\\;(a<_Tb<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\forall c\\in D_T\\;(b\\leq_Tc<_T\\mathbf1_T\\to c\\in P))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(P)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false}],"bytes":1804,"backlinks":[{"id":"53ac2709b362624c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{Low}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-high-low]]；$\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-cofinality]]。"},{"id":"3e076117a0acde14","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eventually}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-cofinality]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-cofinality]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-cofinality]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b"]}